1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
A held action lands on your desk

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,900
Pull to rehearse. The breach flares at the walkway.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:13,200
Twist 250 to 180°/s. The breach clears.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,500
Both hands for 1.5 s. Sealed as reviewed.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Rehearse. Reshape. Decide.
Hands only, on your desk.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
A shift begins: each held action drops into the tray

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Look to inspect. Place a routine action in the slot.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Compare the original and amended paths

9
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Let go during a hold: cancelled, nothing sent

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:03,500
A hard limit locks the execute slot

11
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:11,100
Push it off the desk edge to veto

12
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:18,900
Routine-looking requests still need review

13
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:27,300
Drill revealed after the decision: the rehearsal clips the shelf

14
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:35,400
Pick up a seal to replay what you reviewed

15
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:42,400
Demo signature. Approval, proof and execution stay separate.

16
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:47,200
Gaze + pinch and one-hand alternatives

17
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:51,700
Larger text and high contrast

18
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:59,900
Cyclone — the calm eye where humans decide what AI agents do.
